[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443828207","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5443828207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5443828207,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRHo57w","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T18:55:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T18:57:20Z","body":"> Default the editor tab style to Icon Only\r\n\r\nI don't think it's a good idea. It would be really difficult for new users to navigate the interface, and many might not even know that they can enable text labels for the tabs. With touch input, there also won't be any tooltips to help.\r\n\r\nIf anything, I'd say we can change the default for main screen buttons because those are always gonna be there and are easier to remember. But should keep label for other docks.\r\n\r\n> Default network/connection/network_mode to Online. The Android OS has its own mechanism to enable / disable online connectivity.\r\n\r\nWhy this change?  I think it'd better to keep defaults same as Desktop editor for non-UI settings.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443828207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443941680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5443941680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5443941680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRHv1MA","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T19:05:05Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T19:05:05Z","body":"> Why this change? I think it'd better to keep defaults same as Desktop editor for non-UI settings.\r\n\r\nThis setting affects the UI (e.g. Asset Store showing the 'Go online' button). Given that `android.permission.INTERNET` permission is included in the Android editor manifest, this setting is redundant.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5443941680/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444035948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444035948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444035948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRH1lbA","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T19:12:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T19:12:32Z","body":"> It would be really difficult for new users to navigate the interface\r\n\r\nXogot follows a similar approach without usability issues for new users. In addition, we have several UI elements that are icons only (e.g. playtest buttons, touch actions panel), so switching to icons only should not be an issue.. unless you think the current set of icons are not descriptive enough, in which case that's a separate issue to address.\r\n\r\n> With touch input, there also won't be any tooltips to help.\r\n\r\nSomething we're working to fix, so that should not be a blocker.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444035948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444536261","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444536261","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444536261,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRIUHxQ","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T19:59:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T19:59:08Z","body":"> > Why this change? I think it'd better to keep defaults same as Desktop editor for non-UI settings.\r\n> \r\n> This setting affects the UI (e.g. Asset Store showing the 'Go online' button). Given that `android.permission.INTERNET` permission is included in the Android editor manifest, this setting is redundant.\r\n\r\n`android.permission.INTERNET` permission is so editor can access the internet, if `network_mode` is `Online`. We still keep it `Offline` by default for privacy focused folks, to make sure user explicitly opt-in to allow editor to make HTTP requests.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444536261/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444620311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444620311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444620311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRIZQFw","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T20:07:15Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T20:07:15Z","body":"> > It would be really difficult for new users to navigate the interface\r\n> \r\n> Xogot follows a similar approach without usability issues for new users. In addition, we have several UI elements that are icons only (e.g. playtest buttons, touch actions panel), so switching to icons only should not be an issue.. unless you think the current set of icons are not descriptive enough, in which case that's a separate issue to address.\r\n\r\nEditor does looks clean with icon-only tabs but I do expect usability to be affected by this.\r\nAnd yeah, some icons are not descriptive enough (It's somewhat fine for us because we are already familier with editor interace). I've seen people complain about EditorRunBar buttons.\r\n\r\n> > With touch input, there also won't be any tooltips to help.\r\n> \r\n> Something we're working to fix, so that should not be a blocker.\r\n\r\nRight, but we currently don't have much progress on that :-)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444620311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444655838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444655838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444655838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRIba3g","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T20:10:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T20:10:26Z","body":"> `android.permission.INTERNET` permission is so editor can access the internet, if `network_mode` is `Online`. We still keep it `Offline` by default for privacy focused folks, to make sure user explicitly opt-in to allow editor to make HTTP requests.\r\n\r\nMy point exactly; internet access for Android apps (including HTTP requests) are controlled via the `android.permission.INTERNET` permission and related APIs. As such we have a bunch of Android code for which the `network_mode` setting is a no-op. Hence, this PR updates its default value on Android to reflect the platform behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444655838/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444772777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444772777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444772777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRIijqQ","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T20:21:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T20:21:55Z","body":"> > > It would be really difficult for new users to navigate the interface\r\n> > \r\n> > \r\n> > Xogot follows a similar approach without usability issues for new users. In addition, we have several UI elements that are icons only (e.g. playtest buttons, touch actions panel), so switching to icons only should not be an issue.. unless you think the current set of icons are not descriptive enough, in which case that's a separate issue to address.\r\n> \r\n> Editor does looks clean with icon-only tabs but I do expect usability to be affected by this. And yeah, some icons are not descriptive enough (It's somewhat fine for us because we are already familier with editor interace). I've seen people complain about EditorRunBar buttons.\r\n> \r\n\r\nThinking on it some more, I don't think new users will run into usability issues because from a new user POV, the current text labels mean as much as the icons set.. which is nothing. So I expect them to tap around in order to figure out the interface, and thus build their mental map of the interface.\r\n\r\nThis approach also solves the 'running out of space' issue in portrait mode, especially when dealing with languages where the current labels are long. Icons take the same space regardless of the selected language, which provides consistency on the expected UI size. \r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444772777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444976602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5444976602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5444976602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRIu_2g","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-27T20:41:57Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T20:42:28Z","body":"> Thinking on it some more, I don't think new users will run into usability issues because from a new user POV, the current text labels mean as much as the icons set.. which is nothing. So I expect them to tap around in order to figure out the interface, and thus build their mental map of the interface.\r\n> \r\n> This approach also solves the 'running out of space' issue in portrait mode, especially when dealing with languages where the current labels are long. Icons take the same space regardless of the selected language, which provides consistency on the expected UI size.\r\n\r\nYeah, new users won't even understand text labels but they can atleast follow tutorials or docs.\r\n\r\nMy main concern with icon-only tabs is that there's no way to know the name of the dock (not even for opened tabs). Because of that, I think we should hold off on this change until we have tooltip support for touch input.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5444976602/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5460123003","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5460123003","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5460123003,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRXLdew","user":{"login":"GDevSh007","id":247660653,"node_id":"U_kgDODsMAbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/247660653?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007","html_url":"https://github.com/GDevSh007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GDevSh007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T03:44:14Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T03:44:14Z","body":"\r\nWith Icons only! There will be chances of misclicks here and there when we want to expand or open a particular tab and ends up with different one! Because Icons would remain closer to each other and in small screens being precise with finger clicks is already a kinda issue to me! Can't tell about other users! Plus can anyone please tell me all the functionality of the icons right below the scene tab!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1356\" height=\"425\" alt=\"Screenshot_2026-08-29-09-10-15-627_org godotengine editor v4-edit\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17662ed7-b9df-4100-a980-8dbb5a0dfa48\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nI never explored those due lack of info! If you can suggest me editor settings as where to enable the text for it would be helpful :- ]","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5460123003/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484344253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5484344253","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5484344253,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRuRzvQ","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T20:46:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T20:46:52Z","body":"> If anything, I'd say we can change the default for main screen buttons because those are always gonna be there and are easier to remember. But should keep label for other docks.\r\n> \r\n\r\n@syntaxerror247 I've updated the PR to only change the main screen dock tab style as a start.\r\nWe can discuss the other dock tab styles in follow-up PRs if deemed necessary.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484344253/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5511369881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122900#issuecomment-5511369881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122900","id":5511369881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSIDUmQ","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}